cl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fsomos-mobile.jpg%3Fh%3D780%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=1280&amp;q=85 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fsomos-mobile.jpg%3Fh%3D780%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fsomos-mobile.jpg%3Fh%3D780%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85"/></div></div></figure></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="rich-text rich-text-table corporate:mb-8 corporate:marker:text-sm corporate:marker:text-[#00AF66] corporate:prose-ol:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-ul:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-li:pl-1 corporate:prose-a:text-primary-dark vimovo:marker:text-white corporate:md:mb-[42px] foundation:print:hidden"><div class="ck-content">
<h3 id="somos"><span style="color: #00a89d;">Somos Silesia</span></h3>
<p>Laboratorios Silesia es una&nbsp;empresa farmac&eacute;utica chilena orientada a la salud femenina, que acompa&ntilde;a a la mujer en cada etapa de su vida con productos diferenciados y con valor agregado.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div></section><section class="lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="container grid max-w-[1062px] gap-6 corporate:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="rich-text rich-text-table corporate:mb-8 corporate:marker:text-sm corporate:marker:text-[#00AF66] corporate:prose-ol:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-ul:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-li:pl-1 corporate:prose-a:text-primary-dark vimovo:marker:text-white corporate:md:mb-[42px] foundation:print:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><h3><span style="color:hsl(176,100%,33%);">Nuestra compañía</span></h3><p>Centramos nuestros esfuerzos en la producción de medicamentos de calidad en base a estándares internacionales, con foco en la investigación y desarrollo de terapias innovadoras, así como la importación de productos en base a las necesidades de las mujeres en nuestro país.</p></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="max-w-full overflow-hidden image-container"><div class=""><figure data-match-height="figure" class="relative flex flex-wrap justify-center corporate:flex corporate:flex-col"><div class="w-full"><div class="hidden md:block"><img alt="Nuestra Compania" data-match-height="picture" loading="lazy" width="1070" height="816" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto corporate:aspect-auto corporate:w-full aspect-video corporate:rounded-xl object-contain" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fnuestra-compania.jpg%3Fh%3D816%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fnuestra-compania.jpg%3Fh%3D816%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fnuestra-compania.jpg%3Fh%3D816%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1070&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabs