ing-[52px] zolmitriptan:md:text-[52px] zolmitriptan:md:leading-[56px] compass2care:!text-black text-white" itemProp="headline"><span>¿Qué nos inspira?</span></h1></div></div></div><div><div><p class="text-base leading-5 zolmitriptan:md:text-[18px] zolmitriptan:md:leading-6 text-white" itemProp="description">En Laboratorios Silesia ponemos al paciente en el centro de todas nuestras acciones. Trabajamos día a día para entregar medicamentos y soluciones terapéuticas de calidad, para acompañar a las mujeres en cada etapa de su vida.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="container grid max-w-[1062px] gap-6 corporate:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="rich-text rich-text-table corporate:mb-8 corporate:marker:text-sm corporate:marker:text-[#00AF66] corporate:prose-ol:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-ul:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-li:pl-1 corporate:prose-a:text-primary-dark vimovo:marker:text-white corporate:md:mb-[42px] foundation:print:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><h3><span style="color:hsl(176,100%,33%);">Medicamentos de calidad</span></h3></div></div><div class="max-w-full overflow-hidden image-container"><div class=""><figure data-match-height="figure" class="relative flex flex-wrap justify-center corporate:flex corporate:flex-col"><div class="w-full"><div class="hidden md:block"><img alt="Medicamentos de calidad" data-match-height="picture" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="596" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto corporate:aspect-auto corporate:w-full aspect-video corporate:rounded-xl object-contain" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmedicamentos-de-calidad.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmedicamentos-de-calidad.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26ia