-medicamentos-de-calidad.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85"/></div></div></figure><p data-match-height="paragraph" class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-5 text-grey-dark md:mt-6"><span>Contamos con una planta de producción certificada y un portafolio amplio de medicamentos bioequivalentes y genéricos de calidad.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="rich-text rich-text-table corporate:mb-8 corporate:marker:text-sm corporate:marker:text-[#00AF66] corporate:prose-ol:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-ul:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-li:pl-1 corporate:prose-a:text-primary-dark vimovo:marker:text-white corporate:md:mb-[42px] foundation:print:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><h3><span style="color:hsl(176,100%,33%);">Educación médica</span></h3></div></div><div class="max-w-full overflow-hidden image-container"><div class=""><figure data-match-height="figure" class="relative flex flex-wrap justify-center corporate:flex corporate:flex-col"><div class="w-full"><div class="hidden md:block"><img alt="Educación médica" data-match-height="picture" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="596" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto corporate:aspect-auto corporate:w-full aspect-video corporate:rounded-xl object-contain" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 50vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=256&amp;q=85 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=384&amp;q=85 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=768&amp;q=85 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1280&amp;q=85 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Feducacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="md:hidden"><img alt="Mobile Educación médica" data-match-height="picture" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="596" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto corporate:aspect-auto corporate:w-full aspect-video corporate:rounded-xl object-contain" style="color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmobile-educacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=640&amp;q=85 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmobile-educacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=768&amp;q=85 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmobile-educacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1280&amp;q=85 1280w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmobile-educacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Fproject%2Flatam%2Flabsilesiacl%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fmobile-educacion-medica.jpg%3Fh%3D596%26iar%3D0%26w%3D1200&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85"/></div></div></figure><p data-match-height="paragraph" class="mt-3 text-[16px] leading-5 text-grey-dark md:mt-6"><span>Comprometidos con aportar a la formación de los profesionales de la salud de nuestro país.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2 lg:col-span-2"><div class="rich-text rich-text-table corporate:mb-8 corporate:marker:text-sm corporate:marker:text-[#00AF66] corporate:prose-ol:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-ul:!ml-[1.56rem] corporate:prose-li:pl-1 corporate:prose-a:text-primary-dark vimovo:marker:text-white corporate:md:mb-[42px] foundation:print:hidden"><div class="ck-content"><h3><meta charset="utf-8" /><span style="color:hsl(176,100%,33%);"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Innovación + Hitos</span></span></h3><p>Laboratorios Silesia fue la primera compañía del país en incorporar terapias de reposición hormonal asociando en un mismo comprimido el estrógeno y progestina, una innovación que significó un gran paso en mejorar la calidad de vida de las mujeres durante la menopausia.</p><p>En 2018, en tanto, lanzamos la primera tibolona bioequivalente del mercado. &nbsp;En cuanto a las terapias anticonceptivas, contamos con una amplia gama de productos de última generación y con valor agregado para las mujeres del país.</p><p>La innovación y desarrollo con foco en el bienestar de la mujer es prioridad para nosotros.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="hero-section relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden qpatient:!flex-row qpatient:!items-end md:flex-row md:items-center secondary:print:hidden" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Poster"><style>
